  "id": "nsw_planning_doc_050",
  "text": "Planning Document: Marrickville DCP 2011 - 9 31 Unwins Bridge Road\n\nClause 9.31.2 - heritage (development_control): To protect and preserve the identified period buildings within the precinct and encourage their sympathetic alteration or restoration.\n\nClause 9.31.2 - heritage (development_control): To protect the identified Heritage Items within the precinct.\n\nClause 9.31.2 - height_limit (development_control): To maintain distinctly single storey streetscapes that exist within the precinct.\n\nClause 9.31.2 - heritage (development_control): To protect groups or runs of buildings which retain their original form including roof forms, original detailing and finishes.\n\nClause 9.31.2 - other (development_control): To protect significant streetscapes and/or public domain elements within the precinct including landscaping, fencing, open space, sandstone kerbing and guttering, views and vistas and prevailing subdivision patterns.\n\nClause 9.31.2 - zoning (land_use_zoning): To preserve the predominantly low density residential character of the precinct.\n\nClause 9.31.2 - other (development_control): To support pedestrian and cyclist access, activity and amenity including maintaining and enhancing the public domain quality.\n\nClause 9.31.2 - parking (development_control): To ensure that the provision and location of off-street car parking does not adversely impact the amenity of the precinct.\n\n",
  "metadata": {
    "document_name": "Marrickville DCP 2011 - 9 31 Unwins Bridge Road",
    "extractions_count": 14
